From bbccddee0011223344556677889900aabbccddee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bellatrix contributors <bellatrix@localhost>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 12:35:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] mesa: keep debug header from enabling DEBUG

AROS debug.h defines DEBUG to zero, while Mesa uses #ifdef DEBUG.  Undefine it
after importing bug() so the diagnostic does not change Mesa's build mode.
---
 workbench/libs/mesa/mesa-20.0.8-aros.diff | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/workbench/libs/mesa/mesa-20.0.8-aros.diff b/workbench/libs/mesa/mesa-20.0.8-aros.diff
index fbd343e664..4db315bda1 100644
--- a/workbench/libs/mesa/mesa-20.0.8-aros.diff
+++ b/workbench/libs/mesa/mesa-20.0.8-aros.diff
@@ -1238,3 +1238,4 @@
 +#ifdef __AROS__
 +#include <aros/debug.h>
++#undef DEBUG
 +#endif
-- 
